 "explanation": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "compose all transformations into one affine map a x + b; indexOf inverts it ((target - b) / a when divisible) and looks the preimage up in a first-index hash map; a = 0 means every element maps to b. Complexity target: O(n) construction, O(1) per map and indexOf/O(n) space.",
